  "html": "<table cellpadding=\"5\" style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left; max-width: 300px;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#165d9f; color:#FFFFFF;\"> Carpe cerevisi &lt;CC&gt;\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Carpe_Cerevisi\" title=\"Carpe Cerevisi\">Carpe Cerevisi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Leader\n</th><td> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Zistus\" title=\"Zistus\">Zistus</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Officers\n</th><td> Decrummify, Smoob\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> No. of members\n</th><td> N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Webpage\n</th><td> <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.your-guild-website.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"http://www.your-guild-website.com\">http://www.your-guild-website.com</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> VoIP\n</th><td> No\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Language\n</th><td> English\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> IRC channel\n</th><td> N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Forums\n</th><td> <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.your-guild-website.com/forums\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"http://www.your-guild-website.com/forums\">http://www.your-guild-website.com/forums</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#64a0d8;\"> Time zone\n</th><td> GMT+1\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Guild_Overview\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Guild Overview </span></h2>\n<p>Carpe Cerevisi is an English speaking posse, we normally play on the only European server (PvE world 8). Our name means 'Sieze the Beer' in latin, and is pretty much our posse philosophy :)\n</p>\n<a name=\"Latest_News\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Latest News </span></h2>\n<p>i made the Posse today 17/10-08\nThis is my first page, and im still playing around with it, to see what things do :)\n</p>\n<a name=\"Members\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Members </span></h2>\n<p>Zistus: Leader\n</p><p>Decrummify, Smoob: Officers\n</p><p>Eblia: Founder Member\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
